## Interface: 16001
## Title: Waylaid Crate
## Title-zhCN: Waylaid Crate 箱子性价比
## Title-zhTW: Waylaid Crate 箱子性價比
## Notes: Scans the Auction House for Waylaid Crates and their materials, picks the cheapest fill and ranks crates by cost per Merchant's Favor.
## Notes-zhCN: 扫描拍卖行里的 Waylaid Crate 和材料价格，自动选出最便宜的填法，按每 Merchant's Favor 成本排名。
## Notes-zhTW: 掃描拍賣場裡的 Waylaid Crate 和材料價格，自動選出最便宜的填法，按每 Merchant's Favor 成本排名。
